{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/e440f8ac2f0855f26db7ab7833d45379.avif?t=1770530166\" width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/06265e0a787d084783fe8b7392983acd.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/06265e0a787d084783fe8b7392983acd.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ygg Engine is a fantasy and adventure scenario engine with sandbox and large scale multiplayer features.<br>Explore an open-world with quests and leveling up skills. Or create a unique adventure for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> This time, magic has gone too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1770530166\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH MOBS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.mp4?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/eff7bb4e22afe6ef586d5a4fd661cfca.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/eff7bb4e22afe6ef586d5a4fd661cfca.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why not farm on some rats before you try your luck on a dragon?<br>Watch out, some monsters are aggressive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc3128300f40077e42e81b3815d31388.apng?t=1770530166\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/bc3128300f40077e42e81b3815d31388.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" class=\"bb_img\" width=155 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1770530166\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT RESOURCES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/faedd476ec7667762e2451dc94a27561.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/faedd476ec7667762e2451dc94a27561.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a2a94d28966f3727ed7a329f484b5204.webp?t=1770530166\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/a2a94d28966f3727ed7a329f484b5204.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=280 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collecting resources is easy enough from the safety provided by town walls.<br>Beware of venturing in the wilderness unprepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9aa694265b9d35d2ba03766738c35e0f.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9aa694265b9d35d2ba03766738c35e0f.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1770530166\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD STRUCTURES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/cd13a72e9454a7f57934f50781aa7f29.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/cd13a72e9454a7f57934f50781aa7f29.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/cd13a72e9454a7f57934f50781aa7f29.mp4?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your environment on demand! Building within towns can be limited by property ownership.<br>Players can buy, sell or lease plots within towns for item storage and other conveniences.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ed489f1b71fb98f85986f8d2806787fa.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ed489f1b71fb98f85986f8d2806787fa.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1770530166\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL SKILLS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/934f59dbeab521a25da466f5bb9db460.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/934f59dbeab521a25da466f5bb9db460.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/934f59dbeab521a25da466f5bb9db460.mp4?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Level up your combat and non-combat skills to discover new magic,<br>or money making strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/fb419f8f1d2bd55fe3fdc4aa1e9ccadb.apng?t=1770530166\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/fb419f8f1d2bd55fe3fdc4aa1e9ccadb.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1770530166\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS &amp; ARMOR!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ba55cdb7c6200084d11a316099b1d291.webp?t=1770530166\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/ba55cdb7c6200084d11a316099b1d291.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1000 height=280 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Equip yourself for your battles freely<br>Each piece of worn equipment from helmet to boots is on display<br>Armor and weapons provide different bonuses<br>Metal armor will slow a mage down, so mages avoid that</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1bb9fa5b0eb21bef302910558ecc8765.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1bb9fa5b0eb21bef302910558ecc8765.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1770530166\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TECHNICAL DETAILS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ygg Engine includes a client, server, and editor<br>Ygg Engine runs as a client and server, which can be limited to single-player or opened for multi-player\u00a0<br>Authoritative server design, actions are validated on the server to ensure fair gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c183b1014c2c4fdf2082c137f54c20b6.apng?t=1770530166\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/c183b1014c2c4fdf2082c137f54c20b6.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1991460?t=1770530166","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1991460?t=1770530166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770530166","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770530166","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/e440f8ac2f0855f26db7ab7833d45379.avif?t=1770530166\" width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/06265e0a787d084783fe8b7392983acd.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/06265e0a787d084783fe8b7392983acd.webm?t=1770530166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ygg Engine is a fantasy and adventure scenario engine with sandbox and large scale multiplayer features.<br>Explore an open-world with quests and leveling up skills. Or create a unique adventure for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> This time, magic has gone too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/9e2342b131de353457ef3a9c6414a9fe.webp?t=1770530166\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH MOBS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991460/extras/1d8d6cb1ff981e136855185d72a4fbf1.poster.avif?t=1770530166\" width=1000 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991